OL,3,GNEWSATheatre demolition to continue as
OL,4,Aupgrades approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork to demolish a town's cinema can
OL,7,Fcontinue after upgraded plans for the
OL,8,Fsite were approved.
OL,10,FTelford Theatre, in Oakengates, is
OL,11,Fbeing fully demolished and replaced as
OL,12,Fthe original building, dating back to
OL,13,Fthe 1960s, has "significant structural
OL,14,Fdefects".
OL,16,FThe newly-approved plans from Telford
OL,17,Fand Wrekin Council include a new
OL,18,Fentrance foyer and box office, larger
OL,19,Fcommunity and rehearsal spaces, bigger
OL,20,Fbar areas and additional toilets.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
