OL,3,GNEWSATheatre demolition to continue as
OL,4,Aupgrades approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council has also finalised the
OL,7,Fpurchase of land next to the theatre's
OL,8,Fcar park, which will create more than
OL,9,F30 extra spaces.
